# ============================================
# QUALITY ENFORCEMENT FRAMEWORK - .gitignore
# ============================================
# These rules block report spam and maintain clean repository

# Block all report/summary/completion files
*_report.md
*_REPORT.md
*report*.md
*Report*.md
*completion*.md
*COMPLETION*.md
*summary*.md
*SUMMARY*.md
*INFORME*.md
*FASE*.md
*FIX_REPORT*.md
*AUDIT*.md
smoke-test-report.md

# Block orchestration reports
.project-orchestration/*.md

# Allow design documents (01-09 series)
!01_*.md
!02_*.md
!03_*.md
!04_*.md
!05_*.md
!06_*.md
!07_*.md
!08_*.md
!09_*.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Block temporary test outputs
*-output.txt
*-result.txt
test-results*.txt
coverage-report*.txt

# Allow framework documentation
!README.md
!TEMPLATE_README.md
!ROADMAP.md
!CLAUDE.md
!ENFORCEMENT_README.md
